<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8" />
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
	<title>WA AI Agent • Access Restricted</title>
	<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
	<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
	<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Rajdhani:wght@500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
	<style>
		:root {
			--color-bg: #090909;
			--color-panel-line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
			--color-text: #ffffff;
			--color-muted: #a0a0a0;
			--color-danger: #ff4d5f;
			--font-primary: "Rajdhani", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
			--font-mono: "JetBrains Mono", Consolas, monospace;
		}

		body {
			min-height: 100vh;
			margin: 0;
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			background-color: var(--color-bg);
			color: var(--color-text);
			font-family: var(--font-primary);
			background-image:
				radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(255, 77, 95, 0.12), transparent 40%);
		}

		.restricted-card {
			width: min(520px, calc(100vw - 2rem));
			border: 1px solid var(--color-panel-line);
			background: linear-gradient(155deg, rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.95), rgba(12, 12, 12, 0.95));
			box-shadow: 0 18px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
			border-radius: 1rem;
			padding: 2.2rem 1.9rem;
			text-align: center;
		}

		.badge {
			font-family: var(--font-mono);
			letter-spacing: 0.12em;
			font-size: 0.74rem;
			color: var(--color-danger);
			text-transform: uppercase;
			margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
		}

		.title {
			letter-spacing: 0.04em;
			text-transform: uppercase;
			margin: 0 0 1rem;
			font-size: 1.5rem;
		}

		.message {
			font-family: var(--font-mono);
			color: var(--color-muted);
			font-size: 0.9rem;
			line-height: 1.6;
			margin: 0;
		}

		.message code {
			color: var(--color-text);
			background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
			padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem;
			border-radius: 0.35rem;
		}
	</style>
</head>
<body>
	<main class="restricted-card" role="alert">
		<p class="badge">// access restricted</p>
		<h1 class="title">Login Disabled</h1>
		<p class="message">
			The dashboard is locked by the system.<br />
			<code>ADMIN_SECRET_KEY</code> is not configured, so login is unavailable.<br />
			Ask the operator to set <code>ADMIN_SECRET_KEY</code> to re-enable access.
		</p>
	</main>
</body>
</html>
